{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"层化"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"层化"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>层化是"},{"Local":{"url":"层意象","text":"层范畴"}},{"Plain":"到"},{"Local":{"url":"预层意象","text":"预层范畴"}},{"Plain":"的嵌入的"},{"Local":{"url":"伴随","text":"左伴随"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}